 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "calls are [customerId, callId, startMs, endMs] with start inclusive and end exclusive. Days are UTC days, day = floor(ms / 86400000). For each customer and each day on which the customer has at least one active call, report the maximum number of that customer's calls active at the same instant within the day. A call spanning midnight counts on every day it touches. Return [customerId, day, maximum] rows sorted by customerId then day.",
